flowchart TD
    R[Match request] --> G[Deterministic eligibility gates]
    G -->|ineligible| X[Explain hard-gate result]
    G -->|eligible or reviewable| P{Configured semantic provider}
    P -->|offline| L[Lexical scorer]
    P -->|Ollama| O[Local LLM scorer]
    O -->|success| S[Semantic score and reason]
    O -->|timeout, error, invalid output| L
    L --> S
    S --> E{Embedding provider enabled?}
    E -->|yes| V[Cached pgvector similarity]
    E -->|no or unavailable| C[Existing semantic score]
    V --> F[Weighted explainable result]
    C --> F
    X --> F
    F --> H[Human decision]
